[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Conversation" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/dialogue/conversation.gd" id="1_convo"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_convo")
id = &"n1_osric"
text = "# DRAFT
# Osric, the cellarer, at the kitchen fire at dusk (night 1). Jolly; he feeds you. He promises extra bread at supper (n1_osric_bread).
# If Thomas told the porter about the beast bled by the well (d1_asked_sand), he can ask Osric about it:
# Osric backs the lie, and the cult notes the porter's curiosity (Suspicion +5, the wrong question to the wrong brother).
== start
(A round brother at the kitchen fire, sleeves rolled, flour to the elbow. He beams at you.)
Osric: The porter! At last, a man with an honest appetite. I'm Osric, cellarer.
Osric: Everything you eat in this house goes through my hands.
-> topics

== again
Osric: Back again? Smell that. Patience, brother, patience.
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n1_osric_supper] (Ask what's for supper.) -> supper
* [if not n1_osric_bread] (Say you slept through dinner.) -> bread
* [if d1_asked_sand] [if not n1_osric_beast] (Ask about the beast bled by the well.) -> beast

== supper [set n1_osric_supper]
Osric: Pease pottage, with a little bacon in it for them that work nights. That's you.
Osric: And bread, our own, baked this morning. Rye from our own granary. Nothing bought in.
-> topics

== bread [set n1_osric_bread]
Osric: Slept through dinner? We can't have that. A porter who's hungry nods at his post.
Osric: I'll see you have the heel of the loaf at supper, and a second piece after. Eat it all, mind.
-> topics

== beast [set n1_osric_beast] [suspicion 5]
Osric: The pig? Aye, that was mine to do. I bled him by the well, where there's water to sluice the stones.
(He goes on kneading, and doesn't look up.)
Osric: (He laughs, a beat late.) Leave the kitchen's mess to the kitchen, brother, and I'll leave your gate to you.
-> topics

== leave
Osric: Come hungry! The bell won't be long!
"
